  "text_md": "so we can get\n\n \n\ndt = x2 + b\n\n# b10x1x2 + b\n\n# b10x21x2 + b\n\ndx1\n\n# b210x22 + b\n\n# b210x1x22 + b\n\nb310x31 + O(∥x∥4)\n\n11\n\n20\n\n21\n\n12\n\n30\n\n\n\ndx2\n\ndt = a11x1x2 + a\n\nb10 x22 + a\n\n# b10 x1x22 + a12x21x2 + a\n\nb210 x32 + O(∥x∥4)\n\n20\n\n21\n\n30\n\n \n\nx3 = x1 x4 = x2 + b\n\n\n\n# b10x21x2 + b\n\n# b10x1x2 + b\n\n# b210x22 + b\n\n# b210x1x22 + b\n\nb310x31 + O(∥x∥4)\n\n21\n\n11\n\n20\n\n12\n\n30\n\n \n\nx1 = x3 x2 = x4 + v11x3x4 + v02x24 + v21x23x4 + v12x3x24 + v03x34 + O(∥x∥4)\n\n\n\nwherein:\n\nb11 b10\n\nb20 b210\n\n# v11 = −\n\n,v02 = −\n\n,\n\nb211 − b12b10 b210\n\nv21 =\n\n.\n\n2b220 b410\n\n3b11b20 − b21b10 b310\n\n,v03 =\n\n.\n\n# v12 =\n\nSubstitute the new variables (x3,x4) into the original system, and we can get:\n\n \n\ndx3\n\ndt = x4\n\n\n\ndx4\n\ndt = e11x3x4 + e02x24 + e21x23x4 + e12x3x24 + e03x34 + O(∥x∥4)\n\nwherein:\n\n- e11 = a11, e02 =\n\na20 + b21 b10\n\n,\n\ne21 = a12 +\n\n- a11b11\n\n- b10\n\n\n+ a11v11,\n\n- e12 = a12v02 +\n\n\n(a20 + b11)b10 + a21b10 + 2a11b20 + a20b11 + b211 + 2b10b12 b210\n\n,\n\n2(a20 + b11)b210v02 + a30 + b21 + 2a20b20 + b11b20 b310\n\ne03 =\n\n.\n\nThen make the following transformation for the system (14):\n\n \n\nx5 = x3 x6 = x4 − e02x3x4\n\n\n\n15\n\n(14)\n\n",
